<view class="root theme-{{theme}}">
  <nav-bar title="主题皮肤" showBack="{{true}}" />

  <view class="page-body--plain">
    <view class="intro">换的是纸和墨的颜色，页面结构一点没动。挑一个顺眼的就行，随时能改回来。</view>

    <view
      class="skin card {{theme === item.id ? 'is-on' : ''}}"
      wx:for="{{themes}}"
      wx:key="id"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="pick"
    >
      <view class="skin__preview theme-{{item.id}}">
        <view class="skin__paper">
          <view class="skin__bar"></view>
          <view class="skin__line"></view>
          <view class="skin__line skin__line--short"></view>
          <view class="skin__btn"></view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="skin__meta">
        <view class="skin__name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="skin__desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
        <view class="skin__dots">
          <view class="skin__dot" wx:for="{{item.swatch}}" wx:for-item="c" wx:key="*this" style="background:{{c}};"></view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="skin__check {{theme === item.id ? 'is-on' : ''}}">{{theme === item.id ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="note">碎花的底纹是生成的无缝小图，只铺在纸面上，卡片一律实色，字不会被花挡住。黑金那套同理：斜纹只做底，金色只出现在按钮和入口上。</view>
  </view>

  <paper-toast id="paper-toast" />
</view>
